---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Financial & Advertising Disclaimer | GlobalTaxCalc"
  description="Financial and affiliate advertising disclaimers for GlobalTaxCalc."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Disclaimer', url: '/disclaimer' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Financial & Advertising Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: January 1, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Not Certified Financial Advice</h2>
      <p>
        The calculations, salary estimations, tax brackets, mortgage amortization tables, and FIRE retirement projections displayed on GlobalTaxCalc are generated for illustrative and personal budgeting scenarios. Laws, tax codes, and exemptions vary across individual circumstances. You should always consult with a licensed CPA, tax attorney, or certified financial planner before taking financial actions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        GlobalTaxCalc participates in financial affiliate programs. We may earn a commission or referral fee when you click links or open accounts with affiliate partner platforms (such as high-yield savings accounts, tax software, or mortgage lenders) at no extra cost to you.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
